      "what": "Move the **'Groups'** section *above* the *'The fields'* table. Reformat it as a **two-column grid** (group name + description) with a heading: *'Choose Your Site’s Home: Groups Available'*. Add a small icon (e.g., 🏠) next to each group for visual scanning.",
      "why": "Groups are a critical decision point for new users. Placing them earlier guides visitors to pick a category before diving into technical fields. The grid improves readability, and icons aid quick identification."
    },
