      "what": "Separate the *'People and privacy'* section into two distinct subheadings: **1. Privacy by Design** (covering anonymity and consent) and **2. How Requests Work** (the step-by-step process). Use a subtle divider (e.g., a thin horizontal line) and increase spacing between them.",
      "why": "These topics serve different purposes: privacy reassures users upfront, while the process clarifies next steps. Separating them reduces cognitive load and helps visitors focus on one concept at a time."
    }
  ]
